    "title": "Viktor Hovland's Girlfriend Is Stealing The Show At The Masters [PHOTOS] - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Orlando Silva ,\n1 hours ago\nViktor Hovland kissing his girlfriend. Credit: Kyle Terada-Imagn Images The 2026 Masters is just hours away from its beginning, but fans have already seen a couple of people steal the spotlight, for the best or the worst. With Tiger Woods flying overseas to seek treatment after another DUI arrest, the Masters won’t have the legend on the course.\nPhil Mickelson also pulled out of the tournament, as his family continues to deal with a health situation. Meanwhile, defending champion Rory McIlroy and other challengers, such as Bryson DeChambeau, prepare for the first major of the year.\nBefore the rest of the stars gather to fight for the coveted green jacket, Viktor Hovland’s girlfriend turned a lot of heads with her looks.\nViktor Hovland’s Girlfriend Showcases Golf Talents Additionally, Hovland’s girlfriend, Tuva, made her debut on the course at the Masters Par 3 contest.\nHovland’s personal life has always been private. A hard launch like this turned a lot of attention on social media. X posts racked up nearly 500K views combined.\nVictor Hovland’s best finish in the Masters came in 2023. He finished in a tie for seventh with a 6-under-par score.\nThe post Viktor Hovland’s Girlfriend Is Stealing The Show At The Masters [PHOTOS] originally published on Total Pro Sports .",
